    {
      "name": "Limited Immortality",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Though Krampus still needs to eat, drink, and sleep, he doesn't age and can't die of old age. If Krampus is killed, a new Krampus forms elsewhere in the world after a year's time. The new Krampus retains the memories of the previous iteration and likely holds a grudge against whoever killed him the year before. If a method to disrupt this cycle exists, it has yet to be discovered by mortals."
      ]
